01:55:48.000 --> 01:56:26.000
She was killed in a horrifying way, and now her relatives can only go to the cemetery and stand quietly in front of her grave. You must give the accused what they deserve. A life sentence. The defense reminded the jury that they were sealing the fate of two young people when there was absolutely no motive and no reliable DNA evidence to connect either of them to Meredith's murder. They urged the prosecution to explain to them how the bra clasp came to be moved, and if they couldn't do that, then they should, quote,

