02:14:59.000 --> 02:15:38.000
Amanda was at home with her family when the news came through. A shriek of excitement rang throughout their home as Amanda immediately jumped on the phone with Raffaele and congratulated him on their mutual freedom. Speaking to reporters outside her home, Amanda said, �Right now I�m still absorbing what all this means, and what comes to mind is my gratitude for the life that�'s been given to me." Amanda Knox's claims of police mistreatment went before the European Court of Human Rights in France.

