02:19:43.000 --> 02:20:23.000
wanting to be invisible and wanting to clear her name. In a controversial move, she returned to Italy in 2019 to speak at the country's Criminal Justice Festival, where she addressed the role the media played in the case against her. Through tears, Amanda said, On the world scene, I wasn't a defendant, innocent until proven guilty. I was a clever psychopath, dirty and drug addicted whore, guilty until proven innocent. It was a false and unfounded history that lit up people's imagination because it fed fears and fantasies.

