02:26:41.000 --> 02:27:16.000
The couple's three surviving children released a statement saying that losing both of their parents so quickly brought its own tragedy, but, quote, "...we can take some solace in knowing that they are now united with Meredith and no longer have to live with the grief which consumed them." A poem Stephanie had written for her sister held more power than ever before. Delivered at Meredith's funeral, it read, Remember you are never alone. I am always with you when you roam.

